{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_synopsis", "source_sha256": "54163e574c0d57ef7d24860fa644b83ab9ea106df962041e6a3bb30a004133cf", "ja": "幼馴染でダンサーのメイと会った伊織。父の\n反対でダンスを辞めようとしているメイは\n「私の家は伊織ちゃんとは違う」と言う。\n伊織は最後に自分と共演してほしいと提案し\n自らプロデュースするミニイベントに呼ぶ。", "zh": "伊织见到了同为青梅竹马兼舞者的芽衣。由于\n父亲的反对而打算放弃跳舞的芽衣说出了\n“我们家和伊织是不一样的”。\n于是伊织提议希望她能最后与自己同台共演，\n并邀请她参加了由自己策划的迷你活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1000_007ior", "source_sha256": "14a67a6bb0244a5a67548d5ec4be810138ce5c8055b85da926de5bf5638054bd", "ja": "みんなーっ！　今日は応援ありがとう♪　伊織ちゃんの\nステージ、しっかり目に焼き付けてくれましたか～？", "zh": "大家——！今天谢谢你们的支持♪ 伊织的舞台，大家都牢牢记住了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "87c4d5d13913a76f079ebb73eb3f74880f9a67833353a64b899a2cd4dab8a878", "ja": "ワアアアアア！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "2d5253471fc97a29622d124bc444c6f8f24926d9863cdaa0473ad8351be7588b", "ja": "実は今日の公演で『DIAMOND』を歌おうって\n決めたのには、理由があるの。", "zh": "其实我决定在今天的演出中演唱《DIAMOND》，\n是有原因的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "8b0a603a91b4d074231ff80c2975e6b5bb68a6d7b49f0e6cbae000c2d2f1d1b6", "ja": "私がどうしてアイドルの世界に足を踏み入れたのか。\n今までどんな風に歩んできたのか……。", "zh": "我为什么会踏入偶像的世界，\n一路走来又是怎样走过来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "19999b5dc8746f0e5860e6c94c51a7842b69c7f200cbb2b44d39c8e77bb3b552", "ja": "それを思い返す機会があって、そんな今歌うなら、\nこの曲しかないって思ったからなの！", "zh": "因为有机会回想起那些，所以现在要唱的话，我就觉得只能是这首歌了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "87c4d5d13913a76f079ebb73eb3f74880f9a67833353a64b899a2cd4dab8a878", "ja": "ワアアアアア！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "26d24b9b1e4cefa2724199c9e31e25bce1472fc907c97dd59d4c36d5219f741c", "ja": "この曲が、今、何かを頑張っているあなた達に\n届いていたら、うれしいわ！", "zh": "如果这首歌现在能传达到正在为某件事努力的你们那里，我会很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "e2a628c5db2aeb171c8acec3fbb043347e892805ba8314b921f0f35192841262", "ja": "今日はありがとーっ！", "zh": "今天谢谢你们——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1008_p", "source_sha256": "257c43a94be507f4a302a34472d508fcadae627fc24f46b6b060772f19c9cce8", "ja": "お疲れ様、伊織！\n今回も最高のステージになったな！", "zh": "辛苦了，伊织！\n这次也呈现了最棒的舞台！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "42dede654c1e3ac64abebeeb7e61ba2cabc366b6d68276f83e4260d41d6b28a9", "ja": "当然じゃない！\nこの伊織ちゃんの公演なんだから。にひひっ♪", "zh": "那是当然！\n这可是我伊织的演出呢。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "56aa2314ae5266fee55dd4317226bb19c1fc721b4292306553c26406c66e1339", "ja": "最後のMC、なまら感動したべさ！\nあたし、勇気をお裾分けしてもらえた気がするよぉ。", "zh": "最后的MC，真的超级感动呢！\n感觉自己也被分享到了一份勇气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "a20704bf731c635f5fd662cc91bac3f333538ae785c1c6583d22e26a5d0071b7", "ja": "確かに。ボクも、この曲の受け止め方が、\n今までとは変わった気がしたっていうか……。", "zh": "确实。我也感觉自己对这首曲子的理解，\n和以前相比好像有些不一样了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "1a1c010c4fae357d4353e89078464a154bbadedc6c8e4978dfa19bc9efe6caa2", "ja": "あら、真にしてはよく気づいたわね。実際、込めてた\n思いは、これまでとちょっと違ったかもしれないわ。", "zh": "哎呀，真亏你能注意到呢。实际上，其中倾注的心意，或许确实和以前有些不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "7ab6d1ab6f6c3c5ac40417241128ee69b71383d756338187a9b2b44a6b7d04ab", "ja": "それはもしや……\n友人との一件を経て、でしょうか？", "zh": "难道是……  \n经历了和朋友之间的那件事之后吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "3b8ac4b146c9de3e6e49d4ac24d471754cc5c4bf6f7864bc10fb62f22a11e14a", "ja": "なるほど……メイを応援したいという、\n伊織の友達思いな面が表れたということですわね？", "zh": "原来如此……也就是说，伊织想为梅伊加油，体现出了她重视朋友的一面，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "26c008763b1abbc8e922731271e9a2c8a82f81fd8d22f226d78c3e08c287c250", "ja": "そ、そんなんじゃない……ていうか、\nそんな風に分析するのは無粋よ、無粋！", "zh": "才、才不是那样……话说回来，像这样分析也太不解风情了，太不解风情了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "6b8cd1ecdd7f5e9f34f60d350a0ec428cf6e6338b35a61605636e20c9f6ab082", "ja": "今日の私のステージを見た人たちが、何を思って\nどう受け止めたかは、その人たち次第じゃない。", "zh": "今天看了我的舞台的人会怎么想、又会如何理解，那是取决于他们自己，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b3086d2805d98635ec545b6aafceb6eda5e0a6b09c953f5b3c3c9a15f05887ed", "ja": "そうだな。でも、\n伊織が込めた思いは間違いなく伝わってるよ。", "zh": "是啊。不过，伊织倾注的心意一定传达到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d8d1cf871fcd0c06eb16599aec23dbcefd8a4a88161344d12d084c1a8aa8d2c4", "ja": "『DIAMOND』のもうひとつの側面に、\nきっとみんな元気をもらえているはずだ！", "zh": "《DIAMOND》的另一面，\n一定也让大家都获得了元气！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "88ebbacbe5c3235bd1e3d4cc4efbd0af004c64948bdd9520f16c541c15fcf642", "ja": "う……だ、だから！　そんな面と向かって言うとか、\n恥ずかしくないわけ！？", "zh": "呜……所、所以说！当着面说这种话，\n你就不觉得害羞吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "a3a8cd5f0da94dc2e25b45a577dbfb732517e328e4dcd2a51605e34b8cc8a7c7", "ja": "私はただ、せっかくの原石が輝けないのはもったい\nないって思っただけ。私自身がそうだったし。", "zh": "我只是觉得，难得的原石无法绽放光芒，实在太可惜了。我自己当时也是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "db97bc61bf2a992d8de31b90fb614fe9648aa366c6804b4cc2f8ab18a1e014aa", "ja": "まあ私の場合は、輝かないと世界的な大損失に\nなってたから、是が非でも輝いてみせたけどね！", "zh": "不过对我来说，要是不闪耀的话，可就是世界性的巨大损失了，所以我无论如何都要让自己闪耀起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "6cc9f71d9d32b9fb9447e2c56e1f9aa3c55cafb43ac54129f0f53c9ee4213e9a", "ja": "あれ？　ということはつまり……\nやっぱりメイちゃんを想って歌ったってこと？", "zh": "哎？也就是说……\n你果然是想着小芽唱的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "2b0d415f4e5fc17a073978c82851918dbc1123e3b2469f1019a9a523bdf81a2a", "ja": "ぐぬ……っ！　も、もう良いでしょ、感想会は！\nそれより、ほら！", "zh": "咕呜……！已、已经够了吧，感想会就到此为止！\n比起这个，你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1024_audience", "source_sha256": "f0505579cb5f3b2480ff0a0479309ebf5f27f5f64584b1961ceb624575ad5934", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1025_p", "source_sha256": "915ba5ce31f913546afba4832cbbea37afb500d083a276fcd270c6e3aa5930b6", "ja": "そうだな、感想会はまたじっくりやるとして。\n今はファンの期待に応えることが先かもな！", "zh": "是啊，感想会就留到之后再好好开吧。现在或许还是先回应粉丝们的期待比较重要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1026_007ior", "source_sha256": "ce27b6e634920e87eeda43cd38b42604d3319aa88e0d3cfcd914105385997b97", "ja": "もちろんよ。もっともーっと、伊織ちゃんの眩しさを\n見せつけてくるんだから！　みんな、行くわよ！", "zh": "那是当然。我要去让大家更～加充分地见识\n伊织有多么耀眼！大家，我们上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1029_008tak", "source_sha256": "30224d71f95afa967c387b6513d7bcc534c393cc15c36334b132286ff5d66c36", "ja": "ええ。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1030_038chz", "source_sha256": "2df36b34dd6bcf9447ba44fd19651899046ba39c1d862a1ce50616abc6f726a3", "ja": "ええ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1031_p", "source_sha256": "65faff6e4b204c168a4ef82c894af48f2acac88eb86bdd523d02a442336eb531", "ja": "（伊織は自分で自分を磨き上げた。その輝きは今、\n他の誰かすらも輝かす、光になっている……）", "zh": "（伊织靠自己的努力不断磨炼自己。如今，她的光芒已经化作能让其他人也闪耀起来的光……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_110_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_110_1032_p", "source_sha256": "06a3e7b6db4be691b627c537dde0c0c7aac6f8c6fa388b694d4434ce8fae33c1", "ja": "（光はこれからも、たくさんの宝石を生み出すだろう。\nその輝きを曇らせないよう、サポートしていくぞ！）", "zh": "（这道光今后还会创造出许许多多的宝石吧。\n为了不让那份光芒蒙尘，我也会继续支持她！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
